        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Traffic Flows (confirmed + likely)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;① User → CDN Arvan → web VPS (130.185.75.96) → backend API (178.239.151.33)&lt;br/&gt;② ParsPack ↔ Datacenter private (192.168.88.x): OpenVPN via MikroTik ovpn-server (~/vpn on web)&lt;br/&gt;③ International traffic (all machines): → MikroTik SSTP/L2TP → France 2 (202.133.88.39) → Internet&lt;br/&gt;④ Datacenter hosts: iran-routing sends non-Iran traffic to MikroTik VM at 192.168.122.254&lt;br/&gt;⑤ Backup sync_tool (web) → private IP datacenter via VPN tunnel&lt;br/&gt;⑥ Cloudz 144.172.117.7: future WireGuard egress — NOT in use&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Open in draw.io:&lt;/b&gt; File → Open → weekilaw-network.drawio | Edit freely | Export PNG/SVG" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
