        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p2_flow" value="&lt;b&gt;Traffic Flow Summary&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
1. Production web: User → CDN Arvan → 130.185.75.96 → API 178.239.151.33&lt;br/&gt;
2. Private access: ParsPack → OpenVPN → MikroTik → 192.168.88.x&lt;br/&gt;
3. International: Any host → (iran-routing?) → MikroTik → SSTP/L2TP → 202.133.88.39 → Internet&lt;br/&gt;
4. Iranian destinations: Direct via Iran ISP (ParsPack or radio/fiber)&lt;br/&gt;
5. Backup: sync_tool on web → private datacenter IP via VPN&lt;br/&gt;
6. Cloudz 144.172.117.7: planned, not active" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fillColor=#d5e8d4;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="600" y="420" width="540" height="200" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
